## Step 5: Deploy a Sample Web Page

Open the default webpage:

```bash
sudo nano /var/www/html/index.html
```

Replace its contents with:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Cloud Web Server</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Welcome to Nginx on AWS EC2</h1>
</body>
</html>
```

Save and exit.

